---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
title="Streaming Subscription Policy | Great Gus Productions"
description="Subscription and refund policy for streaming content provided by Great Gus Productions.">

<section class="legal-page">
<h1>Streaming Subscription Policy</h1>
<p class="last-updated">Last Updated: March 9, 2026</p>

<div class="legal-content">

<h2>Subscriptions</h2>
<p>
Streaming content provided by Great Gus Productions may be accessed through
a recurring subscription service delivered via Vimeo OTT under our subdomain: https://watch.greatgusproductions.com.
</p>

<h2>Billing</h2>
<p>
Subscriptions are billed on a recurring basis according to the plan selected
during signup (for example monthly or annually). By subscribing, you authorize
recurring charges to your selected payment method at the beginning of each billing period
until you cancel in accordance with the platform's cancellation process.
</p>

<h2>Automatic Renewal</h2>
<p>
Unless canceled before the next renewal date, subscriptions automatically renew
at the end of each billing period. If subscription plans, pricing, or billing features
expand in the future, updated terms will be posted on this page and continued use of the
service after the effective date will constitute acceptance of the revised terms.
</p>

<h2>Payment Failures</h2>
<p>
If a recurring payment cannot be processed, access to subscription content may be suspended,
limited, or canceled until billing is successfully resolved through the streaming platform.
</p>

<h2>No Free Trial</h2>
<p>
At this time, subscription access does not include a free trial period.
Access to streaming content begins immediately after subscription.
</p>

<h2>Refund Policy</h2>
<p>
Because digital streaming access is granted immediately upon purchase,
subscription payments are generally non-refundable.
</p>

<h2>Cancellation</h2>
<p>
Subscribers may cancel their subscription at any time through their
account settings on the streaming platform. Cancellation will prevent
future billing, but access to content will remain active until the
end of the current billing period.
</p>

<h2>Platform Services</h2>
<p>
Streaming services are provided through Vimeo OTT, which may maintain
its own terms of service and privacy policies governing the platform.
</p>
<p>
Platform availability, billing tools, account management features, and checkout
functionality may also be subject to Vimeo OTT platform terms, policies, and service availability.
</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>
If you have questions regarding your subscription, please contact:
</p>

<p>
GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC<br />
Washington State<br />
<a href="mailto:greatgusproductions@gmail.com">
greatgusproductions@gmail.com
</a>
</p>

<h2>Copyright</h2>
<p>
© 2018–2026 GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC. All Rights Reserved.
</p>

</div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.legal-page {
		max-width: 820px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 4rem 1rem 6rem;
	}

	.legal-page h1 {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		font-size: 2.4rem;
		font-weight: 300;
	}

	.last-updated {
		margin-top: -2rem;
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
		text-align: left;
		color: #bdbdbd;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.legal-content h2 {
		color: var(--accent);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 400;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.legal-content p,
	.legal-content li {
		color: #e6e6e6;
		line-height: 1.7;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.legal-content ul {
		padding-left: 1.2rem;
	}
</style>